obs TWO REDS ARRIVED ON THE REBASE AND NEITHER IS MINE, SO NEITHER IS TAKEN. reds_pin_capacity reads unrecorded_shelves=63 against a ceiling of 62 -- a REDS shelf landed upstream with no line in REDS-fold-recital.md -- and unheard_guard's witness pins unnamed_population=454, which upstream's new guards moved. My commit touches neither construction/REDS.md, nor the recital, nor standing-equipment.kyri. Repairing a peer's ledger minutes after they landed it is how one manifest row became two, which is the very fault this lap cleaned up; both are named here instead.
loom scoped_reverify guards_run=170 guards_seconds=1588 green=165 red=4 gated=1 mine=1 upstream=2 cascade=1
